ps - All Comps featuring {{traitName}}","traitCompsSubtitle":"A list of all TFT Comps featuring {{traitName}} and how to play them: {{compList}}","backToTraits":"Back to Traits","invalidTraitTitle":"Invalid Trait Selected","invalidTraitSubtitle":"Try going back to the main","traitTierList":"Trait tier list","traitStats":"{{traitName}} Stats","placements":"Placements","plusOneTraitStats":"+1 Trait Stats","plusOneTraitSubtitle":"Emblems, Golems or Dummies","traitLevelPlayRate":"Trait Level Play Rate","clickTraitToFilter":"Click a Trait to Filter Stats","traitUnitPlayRate":"Trait Unit Play Rate","clickUnitToFilter":"Click a Unit to Filter Stats","levelDistribution":"Level Distribution","loadingInfo":"Loading Info","noCompsFound":"No Comps Found","viewAllTftComps":"View All TFT Comps","viewMoreBoards":"View More Boards featuring {{traitName}}","andMore":"and more...","traitSynergies":"Trait Synergies","+1 traits":"+1 Traits","plusOneTrait":"+1 Trait","servers":"Servers","traitTierListTitle":"Top TFT Trait Tier List","traitTierListSubtitle":"Stats on the best traits to play in the current meta. Data updates every 5 minutes.","trait":"Trait","unitsTooltip":"Find the most frequent Units and Unit star levels that go with your filters","itemsTooltip":"Find the best Items and Item Holders that go with your filters","buildsTooltip":"Find the best builds for units matching your filters","traitsTooltip":"Find the best traits that go with your filters","compsTooltip":"Discover the best way to cap out your board","+1 traitsTooltip":"Find the best Additional Traits that go with your filters - Calculated via Trait Differences (includes Emblems on Golems, Training Dummies, and Units","gamesTooltip":"The most recent 20 games matching your filters","serversTooltip":"Find how your filters perform on different servers","levels":"Levels","overall":"Overall","byLevel":"by Level","byFinalRound":"By Final Round","explorerTitle":"TFT Data Explorer","explorerSubtitle":"Add Filters to perform queries on realtime TFT data. Searches will only return data matching the filters you select, and aggregate data based on what you want to see. You can click on elements in the table to add them to your filters.","results":"Results","advancedMode":"Advanced Mode:","yourFilters":"Your Filters","noFiltersSelected":"No Filters Selected","startOrGroup":"Start OR Group","startAndGroup":"Start AND Group","endGroup":"End Current Group","addFiltersToGroup":"Add filters to this group","orGroupLabel":"OR","andGroupLabel":"AND","overallData":"Overall Data","gameCount":"Game Count","gameCountFrequencyTooltip":"{{count}} of {{overall_count}} total games- {{percent}}","copyResults":"Copy Results","loadingTotals":"Loading Totals","loadingPlacements":"Loading Placements","advancedSettings":"Advanced Settings:","variable":"Variable:","errorBars":"Error Bars:","confidenceLevel":"Confidence Level:","displayStatsWithConfidenceLevel":"Display Stats with a Confidence Level","confidenceLevelTooltip":"For Overall Data, a 95% confidence level means that there is a 95% chance that the true value is within the range of values displayed.\\n\\nFor Table Stats (Avg Place, Place Change, etc), we use a single bounded confidence interval - which means that there is a 95% chance that the true value is at least as good or better than the displayed value.","searchFor":"Search for","searchDescription":"Separate multiple searches with (\\"/\\", \\",\\" or \\" OR \\") for OR, (\\"&\\", \\"+\\", or \\" AND \\") for AND, \\"!\\" for NOT and use brackets for nested queries ie. \\"Sorcerer & !(Ahri|Swain)\\".","searchUnitsDescription":"You can also search for a Trait (eg. \\"Defender\\") or a Unit Cost (eg. \\"4cost\\")","searchUnitsTierDescription":" or a Unit Star Level (eg. \\"3 star\\")","clickToRemoveFilter":"Click to remove this filter","id":"ID","top4":"Top 4","win":"Win","unitTier":"Unit Level","levelPercent":"Level %","lvlPlaceChange":"Lvl Place Change","unitAndItem":"Unit & Item","unitBuilds":"Unit Builds","comp":"Comp","search":"Search","sampleSize":"Sample Size","minCount":"Min Count:","itemHolder":"Item Holder:","numberOfUnits":"Number of Units:","finalPlacement":"Final Placement:","anyUnit":"Any Unit","anyItem":"Any Item","item_holder_label":"Show Item Holder","unit_tier_label":"Show Unit Level","unit_numitems_label":"Show Item Count","unitTierNumItems":"Unit Level & Item Count","unitNumItems":"Unit Item Count","placeChangeVs0Items":"vs 0 Items","placeChangeVsLowerTier":"vs Lower Level","any":"Any","upperBound":"Upper Bound","lowerBound":"Lower Bound","warningFilterRemovedOptions":"Warning: This filter has removed several options","filterRemovedOptionsTooltip":"This filter has removed {{count}} options from the table. Adjust the patch/date/rank/server filters at the top to increase your sample size, or reduce the minimum count to see more.","augment":"Augment","headlinerTrait":"Headliner Trait","encounter":"Encounter","portal":"Portal","server":"Server","plusOneTraits":"+1 Traits","firstPick":"1st Pick","secondPick":"2nd Pick","thirdPick":"3rd Pick","noAugment":"No Augment","noHeadliner":"No Headliner","unknownEncounter":"Unknown Encounter","unknownEncounterTooltip":"Games in which there were no MetaTFT App users to detect encounters","unknownPortal":"Unknown Portal","unknownPortalTooltip":"Games in which there were no MetaTFT App users to detect portals","noPlusOneTraits":"No +1 Traits","3StarUnit":"3* Unit","4StarUnit":"4* Unit","BronzeTraits":"Bronze Traits","3StarUnits":"3* Units","4StarUnits":"4* Units","TraitItems":"Trait Items","artifactCountOnUnit":"Artifact Count (on Unit)","radiantCountOnUnit":"Radiant Count (on Unit)","emblemCountOnUnit":"Emblem Count (on Unit)","traitCountOnUnit":"Trait Count (on Unit)","anyObject":"Any {{object}}","hasObject":"Has {{object}}","noTraits":"No Traits","noFilters":"No Filters","level_n":"Level {{level}}","lvl_n":"Lvl {{level}}","3Star":"3 Star","2Star":"2 Star","3Items":"3 Items","excluded":"Excluded","on":"on","fromEmblemTrainingDummyOrGolem":"From Emblem, Training Dummy or Golem","searchUnitTraitOrItem":"Search a Unit, Trait, or Item","first":"1st","second":"2nd","third":"3rd","th":"th","anyEmblem":"Any Emblem","ability":"Ability","abilityDefault":"Default","abilityHero":"Hero","abilityNum":"Ability {{index}}","heroAugment":"Hero Augment","commonPowerUps":"Common Power Ups ({{count}})","lessCommonPowerUps":"Less Common Power Ups ({{count}})","upgrade":"Upgrade","warningSlowQuery":"Warning - Slow Query","yourQueryCoversALotOfGamesAndWillLikelyBeQuiteSlow":"Your query covers a lot of games and will likely be quite slow.","suggestedFilters":"Suggested Filters","continue":"Continue","useSuggestedFilters":"Use Suggested Filters","addFilterAboveToMakeQueries":"Add a filter above to make queries","selectFilters":"Select Filters","clearAllFilters":"Clear All Filters","sortFilters":"Sort Filters","enablePredictions":"Enable Filter Predictions","disablePredictions":"Disable Filter Predictions","date":"Date","placementDistribution":"Placement Distribution","playersPerGame":"Players per Game","avgPlaceAndPickRateBy":"Avg Place and Pick Rate by","companion":"Companion","species":"Species","tacticians":"Tacticians","popularVariants":"Popular Variants","loadingCompanionData":"Loading companion data...","pbeDataNotAvailable":"Error: PBE data is not available for this view. Please change the Queue to \\"Ranked\\" at the top of the page.","topCompanions":"Top {{type}}","showTable":"Show Table","showTopFive":"Show Top 5","companionTierListTitle":"TFT Little Legend Tier List","companionTierListSubtitle":"Stats on the best Little Legend companions to use. Data updates every 5 minutes.","unitDelta":"Unit Delta","unitDeltaTooltip":"The Place Change for this unit, vs the Average Place of this unit with no filters.","unitDeltaTooltipExample":"For example, if a unit has a 4.0 Avg Place normally, and a 3.8 place with your filters, it will show -0.2","horizontalLayout":"Switch to Horizontal Layout","verticalLayout":"Switch to Vertical Layout","excludeCashouts":"Cashouts","excludeCashoutsTooltip":"Excludes games with Ornn, Mel, and Brock for radiant and artifact item stats only"}'),tNe=JSON.parse(`{"title":"MetaTFT TFT Overlay","subtitle":"Join over 100.000 users and download the free MetaTFT in-game app. All the stats and data you're used to, with new features including Lobby Scouting, Win Chance, Matchmaking Tracking, and Detailed Match Histories.","appOnlyData":"App Only Data","appOnlyDataDescription":"Get access to data you can't get elsewhere, such as early game comps and detailed match history breakdowns","riotCompliant":"Riot Compliant","riotCompliantDescription":"Meets Riot's 3rd party app policies and won't get you banned","knowYourOpponents":"Know your Opponents","knowYourOpponentsDescription":"We check each lobby, letting you know who to watch out for and how likely you are to be contested","downloadNow":"Download Now","availableForWindows":"Available for Windows - Powered by Overwolf","discoverTheOverlay":"Discover the Overlay","readySetGame":"Ready, Set, Game!","download":"Download","downloadDescription":"Download the MetaTFT App for free, available via Overwolf","install":"Install","installDescription":"Click the downloaded file to begin a quick installation","game":"Game","gameDescription":"The App will automatically open whenever you play a game of TFT","comps":"Comps","compsDescription":"The comps page is even better in the app. On top of the usual data, it gives you early game boards to aim for, and warns you which comps are likely to be contested in your lobby based on the match history of your opponents. Using the app helps us to improve our data too!","lobbyScouting":"Lobby Scouting","lobbyScoutingDescription":"When you load into game, we quickly analyse every player in your lobby and give them tags so that you know who to watch out for, what is likely to be contested, and how stacked your game is.","augmentStats":"Augment Stats","augmentStatsDescription":"Get Live Augment Stats in game, so you can always make the optimal, data-driven augment choices. We detail the average placement, frequency and best synergies of each augment, and even allow you to filter to a specific Comp, so you can make the right decision for your current spot.","earlyComps":"Early Comps","earlyCompsDescription":"Discover detailed early game stats, including the best comps to play by stage, possible transitions, how to position, what items to build and the best levelling strategies","winChanceDescription":"Use AI to estimate the odds of you winning every round in game, based on your board and your opponent","winChanceBullet1":"Improve Your Game Knowledge","winChanceBullet2":"Overcome the odds and beat the predictions through positioning well","winChanceBullet3":"See how strong a board you can assemble","matchHistory":"Match History","matchHistoryDescription":"The app records every round, letting you recap your games with more detail than ever. See how your position/health varied with respect to your lobby, and compare your level and econ pattern to other players of that composition.","detailedRecaps":"Detailed Recaps","detailedRecapsDescription":"Drill down into each round to see how much damage your carry did, and analyse your positioning to better understand why you won or lost.","liveTracking":"Live Tracking","liveTrackingDescription":"The live tracker enables you to quickly access data on the units that you have on the board. For instance, you can look up what the best 3rd item to put on your carry might be, just by clicking it.","matchupTracking":"Matchup Tracking","matchupTrackingDescription":"We let you customise the matchup tracker how you like it - from left to right:","matchupTrackingBullet1":"Display player's ranks","matchupTrackingBullet2":"Whether you can or can't play them (default)","matchupTrackingBullet3":"The number of rounds since you last faced them","matchupTrackingNote":"We also provide a minimap matchup tracker, which many players find faster to use.","compsInGame":"Comps In-Game","compsInGameDescription":"Once you've decided on a comp you like, you can pin it in game as a quick reference. You can expand the comp to quickly access all the information you might need, without having to Alt+Tab","helpPageTitle":"MetaTFT App Help Page","helpPageDescription":"Get help with any issues in the MetaTFT App","clickIssueToSeeFixes":"Click on the issue you are experiencing to see the issue and possible fixes","noLiveDataFeaturesWorking":"No live data features working","noLiveDataFeaturesWorkingContent":"If the matchup tracker, live board, player lookups and win chance aren't working, there are a number of fixes to try:<ul><li>Try the general debugging steps <a style=\\"color:#cbb46c\\" href=\\"https://support.overwolf.com/en/support/solutions/articles/9000202391-overlay-troubleshooting\\" target=\\"_blank\\">here</a></li><li>If there was recently a patch: Patches can break the events that power the app. If the service status is red, you can rest assured someone is working on getting it back up and running as soon as possible - This shouldn't take more than 24 hours. Once this has been fixed (service status green), you may need to quit Overwolf and restart to ensure you have the latest version </li><li>Try running Overwolf as administrator - users have reported that this can help</li><li>Check for conflicting software running: RivaTuner, Nahimic or MSI Afterburner are the most common causes of issues. </li></ul>","overlayAppearsTooLargeOrSmall":"Overlay appears too large or too small in game","overlayAppearsTooLargeOrSmallContent":"This is due to your monitor's DPI scaling. Please follow the steps <a style=\\"color:#cbb46c\\" href=\\"https://support.overwolf.com/en/support/solutions/articles/9000176964-scaling-overwolf-apps-to-appear-properly-with-a-high-dpi-setting\\" target=\\"_blank\\">here</a> to fix it.","winChanceRoundDetailShopAnalysisNotWorking":"Win Chance, Round Detail & Shop Analysis not functioning","winChanceRoundDetailShopAnalysisNotWorkingContent":"If the win chance feature isn't displaying, or the round detail/shop analysis doesn't work properly, the most common fix is to <a style=\\"color:#cbb46c\\" href=\\"https://support.overwolf.com/en/support/solutions/articles/9000202391-overlay-troubleshooting#admin\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Run Overwolf as Administrator</a>:<ul><li>Open Overwolf's installation directory <b>(C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\Overwolf\\\\ by default)</b></li><li>Right-click the <b>OverwolfLauncher.exe</b> file</li><li>Select 'Properties'</li><li>Go to 'Compatibility'</li><li>Check the box for 'Run this program as an administrator'</li><li>Click 'Apply' and 'OK'</li><li>Exit and restart Overwolf</li></ul>","winChanceRoundDetailShopAnalysisNotWorkingContent2":"Please also ensure that Low Resource Mode is OFF in the app settings, as this disables these features as well.","playerLookupsNotWorking":"Player lookups not working","playerLookupsNotWorkingContent":"The most common reason for player lookups not working is you are on an unsupported server that does not have an API, such as China or PBE/Tournament realm. Riot's servers might also have issues, you can check the server status <a style=\\"color:#cbb46c\\" href=\\"https://developer.riotgames.com/api-status/\\" target=\\"_blank\\">here</a>","replayControlsNotShowingWorking":"Replay Controls not showing/working","replayControlsNotShowingWorkingContent":"If the replay controls aren't showing, or aren't working, you will need to enable the League Replay API<ul><li>Locate your league install directory, ie <b>C:\\\\Riot Games\\\\League of Legends</b></li><li>Navigate to the game.cfg file ie. C:\\\\Riot Games\\\\League of Legends\\\\Config\\\\game.cfg</li><li>Open the file in a text editor</li><li>Add the following line to the [General] section: <p>[General]<br/>EnableReplayApi=1</p></li><li>Save the file</li><li>You may have to restart your league client</li></ul>Please note that the replay API is only active when spectating a game or watching a replay, and do not work while playing a live game.","mainDesktopWindowNotOpening":"Main Desktop Window not Opening","mainDesktopWindowNotOpeningContent":"This is likely due to the window being positioned off screen. Select the window and try pressing Windows + Shift + Arrow Keys to move it onto the screen.<br/>If this doesn't work, try the following:<ul><li>Open Task Manager (Ctrl + Shift + Esc)</li><li>Find and End the \\"Overwolf.exe\\" process</li><li>Restart Overwolf</li><li>Launch MetaTFT from Overwolf</li></ul>","faqStillInDevelopment":"FAQ still in development, if there are any unanswered questions please reach out via our <a href=\\"https://discord.gg/RqN3qPy\\" style=\\"color:#cbb46c\\">Discord</a>","serviceStatus":"Service Status","checkingServiceStatus":"Checking Service Status","everythingWorkingProperly":"Everything working properly","someInGameEventsDown":"Some In-game events are down, certain features may not work","inGameEventsDown":"In-game events are down, this affects matchup tracking, match history, live tracker, and may impact player scouting. We are aware and working to get it back up in the next 24 hours","permissionsIssue":"Permissions Issue","permissionsIssueMessage":"Win Chance, Shop Odds and other features may not be working due to a permissions issue. Please exit Overwolf and run it as administrator before starting MetaTFT.","vanguardAdditionalDataDisabled":"Vanguard - Additional Data Disabled","vanguardAdditionalDataDisabledMessage":"Win Chance, Power Ups, Shop Analysis, and other features have been temporarily disabled/impacted by an issue with Vanguard","adminPermissionsRequired":"Admin Permissions Required","adminPermissionsRequiredMessage":"Some Features may not function, click here for instructions to fix","checking":"Checking","green":"Green","amber":"Amber","red":"Red","version":"Version","updateAvailable":"Update Available!","relaunchApp":"Relaunch App","winChance":{"calculating":"Calculating...","winChance":"Win Chance"},"replayControls":{"enableReplayClientApi":"Enable the Replay Client API","instructions":"Instructions","showHide":"Show/Hide","interfaceControls":"Interface Controls","interfaceVisibility":"Interface Visibility","showHUD":"Show HUD","showHealthBars":"Show Health Bars","failedToToggleHUD":"Failed to toggle HUD","failedToToggleHealthBars":"Failed to toggle health bars"},"appSettings":"App Settings","overlays":"Overlays","desktopApp":"Desktop App","hotkeys":"Hotkeys","accountSettings":"Account Settings","augmentRecommendations":"Augment Recommendations","powerupRecommendations":"Power Up Recommendations","itemRecommendations":"Item Recommendations","shopAlerts":"Shop Alerts","shopAlertIndicator":"Shop Alert Indicator","multipleCompShopAlerts":"Multiple Comp Shop Alerts","minimapMatchupTracking":"Minimap Match-up Tracking","showLoadingScreen":"Show Loading Screen","showMetaTFTIcon":"Show MetaTFT Icon (Shortcut to open app)","showReplayControls":"Show Replay Controls (Spectator Mode)","lowResourceMode":"Low Resource Mode","lowResourceModeDescription":"Disables some features to reduce resource usage","inGameInterfaceScale":"In-game Interface Scale","mainAppDisplay":"Main App Display","displayAsDesktopAppWhenSecondMonitorAvailable":"Display as desktop app when second monitor available (default)","alwaysDisplayAsInGameApp":"Always display as in-game app (best for single monitor/full-screen)","alwaysDisplayAsDesktopApp":"Always display as desktop app (best for dual monitor/windowed)","showTips":"Show Tips","startMetaTFTWithLeagueClient":"Start MetaTFT with league client","disablePopupOnGameEnd":"Disable popup on game end","setMatchHistoryPrivacy":"Set Match History Privacy","screenshotEachRound":"Screenshot Each Round","screenshotFolder":"Screenshot Folder","configure":"Configure","showHideHotkeyInGame":"Show/Hide Hotkey (in-game)","showHideReplayHotkey":"Show/Hide Replay Hotkey","reassign":"Reassign","privacyAndAccountSettings":"Privacy & Account Settings","supporterStatus":"Supporter Status","supporting":"Supporting","notSupporting":"Not Supporting","overwolfSupporter":"Overwolf Supporter","patreonSupporter":"Patreon Supporter","useAlternativeApiServers":"Use alternative API servers","useAlternativeApiServersDescription":"Enable this if you're experiencing difficulties loading data.","patchRegion":"Patch Region","patchRegionDescription":"Select your server to make sure data doesn't switch to new patches before they're live in your region.","autoMoveWindow":"Auto move to 2nd monitor","autoMoveWindowDescription":"Moves app to second monitor automatically when game starts.","autoDetect":"Auto Detect","manageOverwolfSubscription":"Manage Overwolf Subscription","managePatreonSubscription":"Manage Patreon Subscription","manage":"Manage","disabledByLowResourceMode":"Disabled by Low Resource Mode Active","disabledTemporarily":"Disabled Temporarily - Vanguard Issue","matchupTrackerDisplay":"Match-up Tracker Display","canOrCantPlaySymbols":"Can or can't play symbols (default)","roundsSinceLastFaced":"Rounds since last faced","playerRank":"Player Rank","priority":"Priority","inGameComp":"In Game Comp","teambuilder":"Teambuilder","pinnedComps":"Pinned Comps","normal":"Normal","ranked":"Ranked","hyperRoll":"Hyper Roll","doubleUp":"Double Up","fortunesFavor":"Fortune's Favor","soulFighter":"Soul Fighter","galaxies":"Galaxies","pengusParty":"Pengu's Party","remixRumble":"Remix Rumble","cannotGetPlayerInfoOnServer":"Cannot get player info on Server: {{server}}","errorGettingPlayerInfo":"Error getting player info","loadingPlayerData":"Loading Player Data","loadIntoGameToGetPlayerInfo":"Load into game to get player info","inGameTryFix":"In Game? Try the fix","peakRankHistory":"Peak Rank History","lp":"LP","games":"Games","backToLobby":"Back to Lobby","viewFullProfile":"View Full Profile","recentNGames":"Recent {{n}} Games","avgPlace":"Avg Place","top4":"Top 4","win":"Win","previousPlayer":"Previous Player","nextPlayer":"Next Player","errorWithPlayer":"Error with player","recentGames":"Recent Games","clickOnPlayerToViewRecentGames":"Click on a player to view recent games"}`),nNe={tipLabel:"Tip",disableTipsTooltip:"Disable Tips (toggle back on in the settings menu)",augmentFilters:{title:"Augment Filters",description:"You can filter augment stats to your comp by selecting it in the bottom left."},shopNotifications:{title:"Shop Notifications",description:"You can enable shop notifications by displaying a comp in game, adding units to the team builder, or by pinning a comp."},liveTracker:{title:"Live Tracker",description:"You can quickly find the best builds for a unit by clicking on the unit in the live tracker."},explorer:{title:"DataExplorer",description:"You can use the explorer to discover stats on specific combinations of units, items, traits, augments, portals and more..."},pinningComps:{title:"Pinning Comps",description:"You can pin a comp by clicking the pin button in the top right of a comp. This enables shop notifications and automatically applies comp filters to in-game stats."},importingToTeamBuilder:{title:"Importing to Team Builder",description:"You can import the top 20 comps to the League Client Team Planner by clicking the Bulk Import button at the top of the Comps tab."},disablingFeatures:{title:"Disabling Features",description:"You can disable any feature you don't like in the settings menu (including these tips!)"},lobbyMatchHistories:{title:"Lobby Match Histories",description:"You can view the match history of players in your lobby in the In-Game tab. Click a player and use the arrow keys to quickly switch between players."},explorerBookmarks:{title:"Explorer Bookmarks",description:"You can bookmark frequent complex searches in the explorer by clicking the bookmark icon. This allows you to quickly re-run searches."}},sNe={recentFilters:"Recent Filters:",suggestedFilters:"Suggested Filters:",resultsWillShow:"Results will show here once filters have been selected",tryExampleFilters:"Try some example filters below",popularFilters:"Popular Filters:",filteringGames:"Filtering {{gameCount}} games to find your filters",gamesFound:"{{totalGames}} Games Found",examples:{bestCompsForCarry:"Best Comps for {{unitName}} Carry & {{traitCount}}+ {{traitName}}",bestItemBuilds:"Best Item Builds for {{starLevel}}* {{unitName}} with {{itemCount}} Items",bestUnitsToReroll:"Best Units to Reroll with {{traitName}}"}},rNe={title:"TFT Augment Tier List",description:"MetaTFT's Tier list of the best TFT Augments to pick in Set {{set}}",pageDescription1:"Check out our Tier List of the best Augments to play in Set {{set}}, maintained by the MetaTFT Esports Team.",pageDescription2:"Augments power up your gameplay in different ways, by giving you more combat power, gold, items, or other more game-changing effects.",searchPlaceholder:"Search {{type}}",searchForAugments:"Search for Augments",searchDescription:'Separate multiple searches with "/". You can also search augment descriptions ie. "Warwick" for augments that give a Warwick.',viewTierList:"View Tier List",playedWith:"Played With:",popularWith:"Popular With:",flexible:"Flexible",strong:"Strong",filterToAugments:"Filter to {{category}} Augments",metaExpert:"Meta Expert",authorDescription:"Spencer is consistently Rank 1 on the North American TFT Leaderboards, recently won the Americas Set 13 Tacticians Cup I, and was one of the top NA representatives at Set 13 Worlds.",augmentTipsTitle:"{{name}} TFT Augment - Tips for Set {{set}}",augmentTipsDescription:"Information, tips and tricks on how to play {{name}} augment in TFT Set {{set}}",scaling:"Scaling",strategic:"Strategic"},iNe={title:"TFT Pro Meta Comps - Set 16 Lore and Legends",pageDescription1:"Discover the best TFT Team Comps & Builds, with this Tier List maintained by Pro Player Sologesang. The New Home for Sologesang's Meta Sheet!",pageDescription2:"Click on a comp to discover positioning, best Augments, and more!",authorDescription:"Sologesang is a high level professional TFT Player - 10th at Worlds in Set 14, regularly Rank 1 EUW, and well known for sharing his high quality meta knowledge."},aNe={title:"TFT Piltover Modules Tier List",description:"MetaTFT's Tier list of the best Piltover Modules in Set {{set}}",pageDescription1:"Discover the best Piltover Modules ranking, maintained by Pro Player Sologesang.",pageDescription2:"Piltover Modules are special items that can be obtained through the Piltover trait and trigger 8 seconds into combat. Each module provides unique effects and abilities.",authorDescription:"Sologesang is a high level professional TFT Player - 10th at Worlds in Set 14, regularly Rank 1 EUW, and well known for sharing his high quality meta knowledge.",modules:"Modules",piltover:"Piltover",loading:"Loading modules..."},oNe={title:"TFT Power Up Tier List",description:"MetaTFT's Tier list of the best TFT Power Ups to pick in Set {{set}}",pageDescription1:"Check out our Tier List of the best Power Ups to play in Set {{set}}, maintained by the MetaTFT Esports Team.",pageDescription2:"Power Ups enhance your units with unique abilities and passive effects that can dramatically change how they perform in combat. Select a Unit to see the best power ups for them.",searchPlaceholder:"Search Power Ups...",searchForPowerups:"Search for Power Ups",searchDescription:"Search power ups by name or description to find the ones you need.",viewTierList:"View Tier List",playedWith:"Played With:",popularWith:"Popular With:",flexible:"Flexible",strong:"Strong",filterToPowerups:"Filter to {{category}} Power Ups",metaExpert:"Meta Expert",authorDescription:"Spencer is consistently Rank 1 on the North American TFT Leaderboards, recently won the Americas Set 13 Tacticians Cup I, and was one of the top NA representatives at Set 13 Worlds.",powerupTipsTitle:"{{name}} TFT Power Up - Tips for Set {{set}}",powerupTipsDescription:"Information, tips and tricks on how to use {