sing MetaTFT to adapt to the meta, learn new strategies, and climb in ranked TFT.",discoverMetaTft:"Discover MetaTFT",getStarted:"Get Started",digIntoTheData:"Dig into the data",digIntoTheDataDescription:"Check out our comps page for the top TFT comps to play, and start digging into the data to discover the best strategies.",downloadTheApp:"Download the App",downloadTheAppDescription:"Download the MetaTFT App on Overwolf to get a bunch more tools and analytics right in your game. The ultimate TFT companion app.",supportOnPatreon:"Support on Patreon",supportOnPatreonDescription:"Like the site? Support our development and unlock more features through Patreon. We're a small team of 2 so your support means a lot!",joinUsOnDiscord:"Join us on Discord",joinUsOnDiscordDescription:"Join our Discord to interact with the MetaTFT community. Suggest new features, share strategies, get help and show off your climb.",tabs:{comps:"Comps",gameModes:"Game Modes",matchHistory:"Match History",augments:"Augments",items:"Items",units:"Units",traits:"Traits",leaderboards:"Leaderboards",inGameApp:"In-Game App"},tabContent:{comps:{title:"Comps",description:"The comps page calculates average placement and pick rate for the current top meta TFT comps. Filters let you customise the page for your rank and region, and you can expand each comp for extra data, including different comp options, positioning examples, and best augments.",cta:"Check out the top performing comps in the current meta..."},gameModes:{title:"Game Modes",description:"Hyper Roll and Double Up game modes have different pacing, and so the meta can be very unlike regular ranked TFT. Thats why we've calculated the top comps for each game mode by exclusively looking at data from those games.",ctaHyperRoll:"See the best comps for Hyper Roll...",ctaDoubleUp:"Or the best comps for Double Up..."},matchHistory:{title:"Match History",description:"Review your games in detail with our match history page. Visualise your climb, see your stats and unlock personalised tags that show your unique playstyle.",cta:"Discover your personal stats now..."},augments:{title:"Augments",description:"Augments impact your game in unique ways. Look up the best Augments, filter by when they're offered (1st/2nd/3rd) or what tier they are, and quickly search for the best ones you're offered.",cta:"Compare and search Augment stats..."},items:{title:"Items",description:"A tier list for the best items in TFT. Select a unit to discover the best items for that unit, best in slot builds, as well as more data and stats on that unit's performance.",cta:"Discover the best items in TFT..."},units:{title:"Units",description:"A tier list of the best performing TFT Champions. You can also filter by an item, giving you a list of the best units with a given item, as well as more stats about that item.",cta:"Compare the performance of TFT champions..."},traits:{title:"Data Explorer",description:"Want to make more detailed queries? Add as many custom filters as you like in order to discover the exact data you're looking for.",cta:"Explore the data now..."},leaderboards:{title:"Leaderboards",description:"Every day, we scan the TFT leaderboards and showcase the top players in each region, and their unique playstyles. Discover what the top players are running, and see what the promotion thresholds are for GrandMaster and Challenger.",cta:"See what the best players are up to..."},inGameApp:{title:"In-Game App",description:"Want all of these features and more, directly in your game? Check out our free in-game app on Overwolf - includes lobby scouting, live augment stats, round by round match history, comps overlay and more.",cta:"Learn more..."}}},bNe=JSON.parse('{"title":"TFT Team Builder - Build and Share Your Compositions","description":"Create, save and share your TFT team compositions with the MetaTFT Team Builder. Plan your builds, test positioning and share with friends.","saveAs":"Save As","saveYourTeam":"Save Your Team","compName":