ds","tablesDescription":"A collection of tables and odds for Teamfight Tactics, including rolling odds, pool sizes, and loot tables.","tftEightBitLootTableSet10":"TFT 8-bit Loot Table - Set 10","eightBitDescription":"Datamined Thresholds and Loot Tables for the 8-bit Trait in TFT Set 10.","tftHeadlinerOddsSet10":"TFT Headliner Odds - Set 10","headlinerDescription":"Headliners are stronger units that grant +1 to a selected trait and are bought at 2 stars.","tftShopOddsLevelChancesAndPoolSizes":"TFT Shop Odds, Level Chances & Pool Sizes - Set {{set_number}}","shopOddsDescription":"The odds of getting a certain cost of unit in your shop at each level, and the size of the unit pool for each cost.","tftAugmentDistributions":"TFT Augment Distributions - Set {{set_number}}","augmentDistributionsDescription":"The odds of each augment tier being offered by stage. Select a tier to filter the results.","tftHeartsteelLootTableSet10":"TFT Heartsteel Loot Table - Set 10","heartsteelDescription":"Datamined Stack Counts and Loot Tables for the Heartsteel Trait in TFT Set 10.","tftFortuneLootTableSet45Revival":"TFT Fortune Loot Table - Set 4.5 Revival","fortuneDescription":"Data-Mined Loot Tables for the Fortune Trait in TFT Set 4.5 - Festival of Beasts Revival.","tftEncounterDistributionsSet11":"TFT Encounter Distributions - Set 11","encounterDescription":"Data-Mined Distributions for Encounters in TFT Set 11.","tftExaltedTraitCombinationsSet11":"TFT Exalted Trait Combinations - Set 11","exaltedDescription":"A List of Potential Unit Combinations that the Exalted Trait can have in TFT Set 11","tftSuperfanItemsSet10":"TFT Superfan Items - Set 10","superfanDescription":"A List of Items equiped by Headliners with the Superfan Trait active in TFT Set 10.","tftCharmDistributionsSet12":"TFT Charm Distributions - Set 12","charmDescription":"Data-Mined Charm Tier Odds by Stage & Charm Categories in TFT Set 12","tftLootOrbTables":"TFT Loot Orb Tables - Set","lootOrbDescription":"A List of Lo