ordle:"A Random 3 Cost Yordle",TFT16_Random4CostYordle:"A Random 4 Cost Yordle",Unknown:"Unknown Prize - Missing Data"},kNe={augmentTierDistributions:"Augment Tier Distributions",clickOnTierToFilter:"Click on a tier to filter the combinations.",clearAllFilters:"Clear All Filters",stage21:"Stage 2-1",stage32:"Stage 3-2",stage42:"Stage 4-2",filteredAugmentCombinations:"Filtered Augment Combinations",selected:"Selected:",firstPosition:"First position",secondPosition:"Second position",thirdPosition:"Third position",silver:"Silver",gold:"Gold",prismatic:"Prismatic"},NNe={metaTftSubscription:"MetaTFT Subscription",metaTftPatreon:"MetaTFT Patreon",whySubscribe:"Why Subscribe?",whyPatreon:"Why Patreon?",supportAppSubtitle:"Support the app and receive the following benefits",supportSiteSubtitle:"Support the site and receive the following benefits",wantToSupport:"Want to Support?",becomeASupporter:"Become a Supporter",becomeAPatron:"Become a Patron",alreadyAPatron:"Already a Patron?",alreadyASupporter:"Already a Supporter?",signIn:"Sign in",linkAccount:"Link Account",supporterExclusiveFeatures:"Supporter Exclusive Features",patreonExclusiveFeatures:"Patreon Exclusive Features",adFreeText:"Supporters will never see ads, either on the website or the MetaTFT App",messageText:"MetaTFT started as a passion project in March 2020 but when we realised how useful the data could be to the wider community we decided to turn it into a site and app. As a small dev team of 2 people with no outside funding, your support helps us to keep developing new features and improving the app. Without our users and supporters none of this would have be possible, so we're super thankful to everyone who's supported in some way!",helloTacticians:"Hello Tacticians",guthersAndWhyando:"- Guthers and Whyando",metaTftDevs:"MetaTFT Devs",unlockMoreFeatures:"Unlock More Features",unlockMoreFeaturesDescription:"Supporters can access powerful features such as Advanced Filters, the Item Assistant, exclusive datasets and more",goAdFree:"Go Ad Free",supportTheDevs:"Support the Devs",supportTheDevsDescription:"We're incredibly thankful to everyone that supports. If you enjoy the site consider supporting us in developing new features",checkOutPatreon:"Check out Patreon",checkOutSupporting:"Check out Supporting",supportOptions:"Support Options",chooseHowToSupport:"Choose how you would like to support the site",metaTftMembership:"MetaTFT Membership",metaTftMembershipPlus:"MetaTFT Membership Plus",bigSupporter:"Big Supporter",perMonth:"per Month",accessToExclusiveFeatures:"Access to Exclusive Patreon Features (see above)",adFreeBrowsing:"Ad Free browsing on the website and in the MetaTFT App",memberDiscordRole:"Member Discord role in the MetaTFT Discord",everythingInPreviousTier:"Everything in the previous tier",earlyAccessToFeatures:"Early access to new/prototype features",memberPlusDiscordRole:"Member+ Discord role in the MetaTFT Discord",everythingInPreviousTiers:"Everything in the previous tiers",bigSupporterDiscordRole:"Big Supporter Discord role in the MetaTFT Discord",helpsUsImprove:"It really helps us to keep improving the website and app",advancedFilters:"Advanced Filters",advancedFiltersDescription:"The Advanced Filters lets you find the best compositions for your selected units or traits. The Comps page updates to reflect the selected filters, with options to display the best or most frequent comps, and show comps with different numbers of units. This helps to quickly find good comp options that include your filter selections",itemAssistant:"Item Assistant",itemAssistantDescription:"The Item Assistant enables the comps page to suggest more viable builds, based on the components you add as filters. It also re-orders the comps so that the best compositions for your items appear at the top, helping to identify good comps and pivot opportunities given your item filters.",oneTricks:"One-Tricks",oneTricksDescription:"We look at all players that only play one comp and break down their most common boards, which items they build the most, and estimate their carousel priority. You can use this to discover different strategies that other players are using to succeed.",checkOutOneTricksPage:"Check out the One-tricks page here",compBrowser:"Comp Browser",compBrowserDescription:"The Comp Browser lets you search the average placement and frequency of every final composition, so you can find the best versions of your favourite comps, and search for new up-and-coming compositions!",discoverNewCompositions:"Discover new compositions using the Comp Browser",discordBenefits:"Discord Benefits",discordBenefitsDescription:"All Supporters get an exclusive role in the MetaTFT Discord as a thanks for your support, as well as access to members only channels & prioritised support.",unlockDiscordBenefits:"Unlock your Discord Benefits",inGameAppBenefits:"In-Game App Benefits",inGameAppBenefitsDescription:"A Patreon subscription also unlocks all of these benefits in the app too, as well as removing ads. You can sign in with Patreon using the Purple button on the Comps tab in the App.",downloadAppHere:"Download the app here"},INe={navigation:qke,common:Yke,comps:Kke,filters:Xke,shopOverlay:Jke,tiers:Qke,gameElements:Zke,stats:eNe,app:tNe,tips:nNe,explorerLoading:sNe,augmentTierList:rNe,proComps:iNe,piltoverModules:aNe,powerupTierList:oNe,animaSquadTierList:lNe,unitDetails:cNe,accounts:uNe,buttons:dNe,playerProfile:pNe,liveTracker:hNe,adBox:fNe,tags:mNe,playerScouting:gNe,spectate:vNe,loading:yNe,matchups:_Ne,home:xNe,teambuilder:bNe,vods:SNe,tables:TNe,prizes:wNe,prizeDescriptions:CNe,augmentOddsVisualizer:kNe,patreon:NNe};function ENe(e){return e.startsWith("en")?"en_us":e.startsWith("es")?"es_es":e=="vn_vn"?"vi_vn":e}const ANe=localStorage.getItem("translatorDev")==="true",PNe=ANe?"https://api.metatft.com/live-translations-api/locales/{{lng}}.json":"https://data.metatft.com/locales/{{lng}}.json";Do.use(iZ).use(lZ).use(xxe).init({fallbackLng:"en_us",debug:!1,res